# mangowc-caelestia: el shell de caelestia para MangoWC (port de Ackerman-00)
# y su CLI, desde UN repo. Split package: mangowc-caelestia-shell y
# mangowc-caelestia-cli.
#
# Fuente: este mismo repo, lo COMMITEADO (makepkg clona con git; lo que no esté
# commiteado no entra).
#
# pkgver se calcula al cargar este archivo, del HEAD del repo, y NO con una función
# pkgver(): makepkg reescribe la línea pkgver= del PKGBUILD tras llamarla, y cada
# construcción dejaba el clon sucio (2026-10-06). Es la misma fórmula que espera
# install/setup-caelestia.sh de dotfiles: 0.0.<commits>.g<sha corto>.
#
# Uso, desde packaging/arch/:  makepkg -si

pkgbase=mangowc-caelestia
pkgname=('mangowc-caelestia-cli' 'mangowc-caelestia-shell')
_srcname=mangowc-caelestia
_repo="${startdir%/packaging/arch}"
pkgver="0.0.$(git -C "$_repo" rev-list --count HEAD).g$(git -C "$_repo" rev-parse --short HEAD)"
pkgrel=1
arch=('x86_64')
url='https://github.com/Ackerman-00/caelestia-shell-mango'
license=('GPL-3.0-only')
makedepends=('git' 'cmake' 'ninja' 'pkgconf' 'qt6-shadertools' 'qt6-base' 'qt6-declarative'
             'libpipewire' 'libcava' 'aubio' 'fftw' 'libqalculate'
             'python-build' 'python-installer' 'python-hatchling')
source=("$_srcname::git+file://$_repo"
        'caelestia-shell')
sha256sums=('SKIP'
            'SKIP')

build() {
    cmake -S "$srcdir/$_srcname" -B build -G Ninja \
        -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=RelWithDebInfo \
        -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/ \
        -DVERSION="${pkgver%.g*}" \
        -DGIT_REVISION="$(git -C "$srcdir/$_srcname" rev-parse --short=12 HEAD)" \
        -DDISTRIBUTOR="Arch PKGBUILD ($pkgbase)" \
        -DENABLE_MODULES="extras;plugin;shell" \
        -DINSTALL_LIBDIR=usr/lib/caelestia \
        -DINSTALL_QMLDIR=usr/lib/qt6/qml \
        -DINSTALL_QSCONFDIR=etc/xdg/quickshell/caelestia
    cmake --build build

    cd "$srcdir/$_srcname/cli"
    python -m build --wheel --no-isolation --outdir "$srcdir/cli-dist"
}

package_mangowc-caelestia-cli() {
    pkgdesc='MangoWC port of the Caelestia main control script'
    arch=('any')
    depends=('python' 'python-pillow' 'python-materialyoucolor' 'libnotify' 'swappy' 'grim' 'dart-sass'
             'wl-clipboard' 'slurp' 'gpu-screen-recorder' 'dconf' 'cliphist' 'fuzzel' 'git')
    provides=('caelestia-cli' 'caelestia-cli-mango')
    conflicts=('caelestia-cli' 'caelestia-cli-git' 'caelestia-cli-mango')
    replaces=('caelestia-cli-mango')

    python -m installer --destdir="$pkgdir" "$srcdir"/cli-dist/*.whl
    install -Dm644 "$srcdir/$_srcname/cli/completions/caelestia.fish" \
        "$pkgdir/usr/share/fish/vendor_completions.d/caelestia.fish"
    install -Dm644 "$srcdir/$_srcname/LICENSE" "$pkgdir/usr/share/licenses/$pkgname/LICENSE"
}

# La config va a /etc/xdg/quickshell/caelestia (el valor por defecto de su CMake):
# el CLI la busca con `qs -c caelestia` (cli/src/caelestia/subcommands/shell.py).
package_mangowc-caelestia-shell() {
    pkgdesc='Caelestia shell for MangoWC (Ackerman-00 port)'
    depends=('mangowc-caelestia-cli' 'quickshell' 'mangowm' 'qt6-base' 'qt6-declarative' 'qt6-wayland'
             'libpipewire' 'networkmanager' 'lm_sensors' 'libcava' 'aubio' 'fftw' 'libqalculate'
             'grim' 'swappy' 'wl-clipboard' 'cliphist' 'libnotify' 'procps-ng' 'util-linux' 'libxml2'
             'app2unit' 'polkit' 'iproute2' 'bash' 'xkeyboard-config' 'gcc-libs' 'glibc'
             'ttf-material-symbols-variable' 'ttf-rubik-vf' 'ttf-cascadia-code-nerd')
    optdepends=('ddcutil: brillo de monitores externos'
                'brightnessctl: brillo de la pantalla interna'
                'power-profiles-daemon: perfiles de energía'
                'fprintd: desbloqueo con huella'
                'fish: scripts auxiliares del shell'
                'hyprpicker: selector de color (mango/caelestia.conf)'
                'ydotool: pegar lo último copiado (mango/caelestia.conf)'
                'foot: terminal por defecto de mango/caelestia.conf')
    provides=('caelestia-shell-mango')
    conflicts=('caelestia-shell-mango' 'caelestia-shell-mango-git' 'caelestia-shell-mango-ackerman'
               'caelestia-shell' 'caelestia-shell-git')
    replaces=('caelestia-shell-mango-ackerman')

    DESTDIR="$pkgdir" cmake --install build
    install -Dm755 "$srcdir/caelestia-shell" "$pkgdir/usr/bin/caelestia-shell"
    chmod 755 "$pkgdir/etc/xdg/quickshell/caelestia/assets/wrap_term_launch.sh"
    install -Dm644 "$srcdir/$_srcname/LICENSE" "$pkgdir/usr/share/licenses/$pkgname/LICENSE"
}
